8716333,2024-04-07,Student loan,Federal student loan servicing,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"As of XXXX, XXXX, I was in possession of three XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  ( Parent loans ) serviced by EdFinancial Services ( XXXX ), totaling {$67000.00}. These loans were each used to fund my daughters college tuition at XXXX XXXX  XXXX XXXX XXXX  from XXXX to XXXX. 

