8789007,2024-04-16,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Managing the loan or lease,Problem with additional products or services purchased with the loan,"on XX/XX/XXXX2023, I purchased a car and Exeter Finance LLC. was the lender. 

on XX/XX/XXXX/2023 the car was totaled. 

my insurance paid their assessment and gap insurance covered the rest. 

during this time, exeter finance advised me that the {$2500.00} service contract purchased with the car and included in my finance amount had been canceled and refund issued. 

